  "name": "albireo",
  "description": "GPU-accelerated Bayesian spectral disentangling of double- and multiple-lined spectroscopic binaries. albireo jointly infers the orbital elements and the individual component spectra from a time series of composite spectra, marginalizing the component spectra analytically so that only the low-dimensional orbit is sampled, and reporting posterior uncertainties on both.",
